WEBVTT

00:03:58.109 --> 00:04:02.697
And also I felt it was appropriate
because it was a warning.

00:04:03.281 --> 00:04:05.366
The subtitle was more important:

00:04:05.366 --> 00:04:08.953
"Why Vladimir Putin and the Enemies
of the Free World Must Be Stopped."

00:04:09.912 --> 00:04:12.373
The publisher, by the way, didn't like it.

00:04:12.373 --> 00:04:14.125
"Enemies."

00:04:14.917 --> 00:04:16.085
It's too harsh.

00:04:16.127 --> 00:04:17.461
Sounded like Cold War.

00:04:17.461 --> 00:04:18.629
"Absolutely," I said.

00:04:18.671 --> 00:04:21.048
"Cold War because winter is coming."

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:22.258
(Laughter)

00:04:22.967 --> 00:04:26.554
Well, here we are, seven years later.

00:04:26.595 --> 00:04:28.347
And if I wrote a sequel,

00:04:28.347 --> 00:04:31.017
it would be called “Winter Is Here.”